# ==============================================================================
# NISHANTH PORTFOLIO — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# Note: Keep all secret values blank in this template. Never commit real credentials.
# In production (Netlify), configure these in Site settings > Environment variables.
# ==============================================================================

# Firebase Admin Configuration (Server-side Firestore persistence)
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Resend API Configuration (Server-side notification delivery)
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Note: CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL and CONTACT_SENDER_EMAIL are pre-configured
# in src/lib/resend.ts with defaults ('adepunishanth1@gmail.com' and 'onboarding@resend.dev').
# Do NOT add CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL to Netlify environment variables, as Netlify's
# secret scanner will flag it when finding your public email in the site's footer.
